{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56786","headline":"吴清妻受仙诗（其二） · 不详","name":"吴清妻受仙诗（其二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心清境静闻妙香，忆昔期君隐处当。\n一星莲花山头饭，黄精仙人掌上经。\n（见中华书局排印汪绍楹校本《太平广记》卷六七引卢肇《逸史》）（按：吴清妻受仙诗共四首，《全唐诗》卷八六三皆收入，但第二首缺首十字。\n谈刻本《太平广记》所缺同。\n汪绍楹先生据清黄晟刻本爲补足之，今据以重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}